{"2661220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "L.A.W Transporter", "steam_appid": 2661220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Transporter ... not one size fits all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L.A.W Transporter is a transporter game that does a lot of things differently.  <br>No endless straight roads, no perfectly tuned vehicles with realistic driving behavior, this is more about fun and innovation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to transport goods with drift vehicles or racing cars and also go off-road?<br>Then you've definitely come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you looking for a game that offers the same old stuff as all the other games?<br>Then keep looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find extreme roads, mountains and valleys, different biomes and a completely customizable vehicle system.<br>Different surfaces offer different driving behavior, and there are also different types of tires that offer different driving behavior on different surfaces. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You transport 7 different goods and passengers to their destination and earn money that you can invest in new vehicles and tuning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are helping you to increase your income and unlock better and more challenging jobs and some specials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don´t want to follow the street? Try offroading, no borders, just open world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vehicle system was created by scratch and setten up to change the vehicles in all possible ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger wheels, better engine-performance, raising body height, changing center of mass?<br>Everything is possible.<br>(more features planned)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gymkhana Trophy Truck?<br>Yes, that is also possible ^^</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPADS + STEAM-DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is optimated for Gamepad and Steam-Deck.<br>All menus are accessable with gamepads.<br>The steam-deck has its own savegame for settings.<br>Career-Mode is shared between computer and steam-deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS-SETTINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like cel shading + outlining?<br>Then disable it. <br>There are more than enough settings to satisfy everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO = ALPHA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is the last alpha version, only 7 of 80+ vehicles are available.   <br>The demo will get no updates anymore, till v1.0 is published.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Differences to the current version:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 63+ more vehicles<br>- Career + Savegame<br>- Achievements and skills can be unlocked<br>- Sell vehicles<br>- more cargo locations<br>- better minimap<br>- some bugfixes, enhancements and optimizations</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Transporter ... not one size fits all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L.A.W Transporter is a transporter game that does a lot of things differently.  <br>No endless straight roads, no perfectly tuned vehicles with realistic driving behavior, this is more about fun and innovation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to transport goods with drift vehicles or racing cars and also go off-road?<br>Then you've definitely come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you looking for a game that offers the same old stuff as all the other games?<br>Then keep looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find extreme roads, mountains and valleys, different biomes and a completely customizable vehicle system.<br>Different surfaces offer different driving behavior, and there are also different types of tires that offer different driving behavior on different surfaces. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You transport 7 different goods and passengers to their destination and earn money that you can invest in new vehicles and tuning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are helping you to increase your income and unlock better and more challenging jobs and some specials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don´t want to follow the street? Try offroading, no borders, just open world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vehicle system was created by scratch and setten up to change the vehicles in all possible ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger wheels, better engine-performance, raising body height, changing center of mass?<br>Everything is possible.<br>(more features planned)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gymkhana Trophy Truck?<br>Yes, that is also possible ^^</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPADS + STEAM-DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is optimated for Gamepad and Steam-Deck.<br>All menus are accessable with gamepads.<br>The steam-deck has its own savegame for settings.<br>Career-Mode is shared between computer and steam-deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS-SETTINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like cel shading + outlining?<br>Then disable it. <br>There are more than enough settings to satisfy everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO = ALPHA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is the last alpha version, only 7 of 80+ vehicles are available.   <br>The demo will get no updates anymore, till v1.0 is published.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Differences to the current version:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 63+ more vehicles<br>- Career + Savegame<br>- Achievements and skills can be unlocked<br>- Sell vehicles<br>- more cargo locations<br>- better minimap<br>- some bugfixes, enhancements and optimizations</p>", "short_description": "Transport different types of cargo by land, air, and water. Configure your vehicles in various ways—anything is possible. All models and code are created by one autistic man.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661220/header.jpg?t=1756481818", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661220/b309f4578e1e7fccd6fba8939e8642ddccbe427d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756481818", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661220/b309f4578e1e7fccd6fba8939e8642ddccbe427d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756481818", "website": "https://discord.com/invite/A6X7qCH", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10/11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 Cores @ 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4gb Vram or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you can run it on lower specs, give me your feedback ^^</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10/11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 10 Cores @ 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16384 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8gb Vram or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<stro